        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You channel sunlight into life-giving flames. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Natural Medicine] skill feat. As long as you have access to fire, you gain the +2 circumstance bonus to your check to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Treat Wounds] using Nature granted by the feat, and you restore an additional @Damage[(ternary(gte(@actor.skills.nature.rank,4),5,ternary(gte(@actor.skills.nature.rank,3),3,ternary(gte(@actor.skills.nature.rank,2),2,1)))d4)[healing]] Hit Points on a success. The additional healing increases to 2d4 if you're an expert in Nature, 3d4 if you're a master in Nature, and 5d4 if you're legendary in Nature.</p>"
